  "body": "## Finding description and impact\n\nMissing validation checks in `ShareTokenUpgradeable.unregisterVault()` will cause complete loss of user fund access as the contract owner will unregister vaults while assets are invested in external investment vaults, leaving users unable to redeem their shares.\n\n## Finding Description\n\nIn `src/ShareTokenUpgradeable.sol`, the `unregisterVault()` function performs insufficient validation before unregistering a vault:\n\n```solidity\nif (IERC20(asset).balanceOf(vaultAddress) != 0) {\n    revert CannotUnregisterVaultAssetBalance();\n}\n```\n\nThis check only verifies that the vault's **physical token balance** is zero, but fails to check:\n1. Outstanding user shares representing claims on invested assets\n2. Assets invested in the investment vault via `investAssets()` (tracked by `getInvestedAssets()`)\n3. Investment vault positions held by the ShareToken contract\n\nWhen assets are invested via `investAssets()`, they are transferred to an investment vault, causing the main vault's balance to become zero. The function `totalAssets()` also returns zero by design (excludes invested assets to prevent double-counting). This allows unregistration to succeed even though:\n- Users hold shares representing claims on the invested assets\n- The ShareToken contract tracks invested assets via `getInvestedAssets()`\n- Assets physically exist in the investment vault\n\n## Recommended mitigation steps\n\nAdd validation to `unregisterVault()` to check for outstanding user shares and invested assets:\n\n```solidity\nfunction unregisterVault(address asset) external onlyOwner {\n    ShareTokenStorage storage $ = _getShareTokenStorage();\n    address vaultAddress = $.assetToVault[asset];\n    \n    if (vaultAddress == address(0)) revert VaultNotRegistered();\n    \n    ERC7575VaultUpgradeable vault = ERC7575VaultUpgradeable(vaultAddress);\n    VaultMetrics memory metrics = vault.getVaultMetrics();\n    \n    // Existing checks\n    if (metrics.isActive) revert VaultStillActive();\n    if (metrics.totalPendingDepositAssets != 0) revert CannotUnregisterVaultPendingDeposits();\n    if (metrics.totalClaimableRedeemAssets != 0) revert CannotUnregisterVaultClaimableRedeems();\n    if (metrics.totalCancelDepositAssets != 0) revert CannotUnregisterVaultCancelDeposits();\n    if (metrics.activeDepositRequestersCount != 0) revert CannotUnregisterVaultActiveDepositers();\n    if (metrics.activeRedeemRequestersCount != 0) revert CannotUnregisterVaultActiveRedeemers();\n    \n    // NEW: Check for invested assets\n    if ($.investedAssets != 0) {\n        revert CannotUnregisterVaultInvestedAssets();\n    }\n    \n   \n    // Check total supply if this is the only vault for this asset\n    if ($.assetToVault[asset] == vaultAddress && totalSupply() > 0) {\n        revert CannotUnregisterVaultOutstandingShares();\n    }\n    \n    // safety check\n    if (IERC20(asset).balanceOf(vaultAddress) != 0) {\n        revert CannotUnregisterVaultAssetBalance();\n    }\n    \n    \n}\n```",
  "proof_of_concept": "```solidity\n// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\npragma solidity ^0.8.30;\n\nimport {Test} from \"forge-std/Test.sol\";\nimport {ERC20Faucet6} from \"../src/ERC20Faucet6.sol\";\nimport {ERC7575VaultUpgradeable} from \"../src/ERC7575VaultUpgradeable.sol\";\nimport {ShareTokenUpgradeable} from \"../src/ShareTokenUpgradeable.sol\";\nimport {WERC7575ShareToken} from \"../src/WERC7575ShareToken.sol\";\nimport {WERC7575Vault} from \"../src/WERC7575Vault.sol\";\nimport {ERC1967Proxy} from \"@openzeppelin/contracts/proxy/ERC1967/ERC1967Proxy.sol\";\nimport {IERC20Metadata} from \"@openzeppelin/contracts/token/ERC20/extensions/IERC20Metadata.sol\";\n\ncontract UnregisterVaultWithInvestedAssetsExploit is Test {\n    ShareTokenUpgradeable public mainShareToken;\n    ERC7575VaultUpgradeable public mainVault;\n    WERC7575ShareToken public investmentShareToken;\n    WERC7575Vault public investmentVault;\n    ERC20Faucet6 public usdc;\n    \n    address public owner;\n    address public investmentManager;\n    address public alice;\n    \n    uint256 constant DEPOSIT_AMOUNT = 10_000 * 1e6;\n    \n    function setUp() public {\n        owner = address(this);\n        investmentManager = makeAddr(\"investmentManager\");\n        alice = makeAddr(\"alice\");\n        \n        usdc = new ERC20Faucet6(\"USD Coin\", \"USDC\", 1_000_000 * 1e6);\n        \n        mainShareToken = _deployShareToken(\"Main Share Token\", \"MAIN\");\n        mainVault = _deployVault(address(usdc), address(mainShareToken));\n        mainShareToken.registerVault(address(usdc), address(mainVault));\n        \n        investmentShareToken = new WERC7575ShareToken(\"Investment Shares\", \"INV\");\n        investmentVault = new WERC7575Vault(address(usdc), investmentShareToken);\n        investmentShareToken.registerVault(address(usdc), address(investmentVault));\n        investmentShareToken.setKycVerified(address(mainShareToken), true);\n        \n        mainShareToken.setInvestmentShareToken(address(investmentShareToken));\n        mainShareToken.setInvestmentManager(investmentManager);\n        \n        usdc.transfer(alice, DEPOSIT_AMOUNT);\n    }\n    \n    function test_UnregisterVaultWithInvestedAssets() public {\n        // User deposits\n        vm.startPrank(alice);\n        usdc.approve(address(mainVault), DEPOSIT_AMOUNT);\n        mainVault.requestDeposit(DEPOSIT_AMOUNT, alice, alice);\n        vm.stopPrank();\n        \n        vm.prank(investmentManager);\n        mainVault.fulfillDeposit(alice, DEPOSIT_AMOUNT);\n        \n        vm.prank(alice);\n        uint256 shares = mainVault.deposit(DEPOSIT_AMOUNT, alice);\n        \n        assertGt(shares, 0);\n        assertEq(usdc.balanceOf(address(mainVault)), DEPOSIT_AMOUNT);\n        \n        // Investment manager invests all assets\n        vm.prank(investmentManager);\n        mainVault.investAssets(DEPOSIT_AMOUNT);\n        \n        // Verify critical state (the vulnerability conditions)\n        assertEq(mainVault.totalAssets(), 0, \"Vault totalAssets should be 0\");\n        assertEq(usdc.balanceOf(address(mainVault)), 0, \"Vault balance should be 0\");\n        assertEq(mainShareToken.balanceOf(alice), shares, \"User should still have shares\");\n        assertGt(mainShareToken.getInvestedAssets(), 0, \"Invested assets should exist\");\n        assertEq(usdc.balanceOf(address(investmentVault)), DEPOSIT_AMOUNT, \"Assets should be in investment vault\");\n        \n        // Owner unregisters vault (vulnerability)\n        vm.prank(owner);\n        mainVault.setVaultActive(false);\n        \n        // All unregisterVault() checks will pass\n        ERC7575VaultUpgradeable.VaultMetrics memory metrics = mainVault.getVaultMetrics();\n        assertFalse(metrics.isActive);\n        assertEq(metrics.totalPendingDepositAssets, 0);\n        assertEq(metrics.totalClaimableRedeemAssets, 0);\n        assertEq(metrics.activeDepositRequestersCount, 0);\n        assertEq(metrics.activeRedeemRequestersCount, 0);\n        assertEq(usdc.balanceOf(address(mainVault)), 0);\n        \n        // Unregister - this succeeds despite outstanding shares and investments\n        vm.prank(owner);\n        mainShareToken.unregisterVault(address(usdc));\n        \n        // Verify\n        assertEq(mainShareToken.vault(address(usdc)), address(0), \"Vault should be unregistered\");\n        assertEq(mainShareToken.balanceOf(alice), shares, \"User shares should still exist\");\n        assertGt(mainShareToken.getInvestedAssets(), 0, \"Invested assets should still be tracked\");\n        assertEq(usdc.balanceOf(address(investmentVault)), DEPOSIT_AMOUNT, \"Assets should remain in investment vault\");\n    }\n    \n    function _deployShareToken(string memory name, string memory symbol) \n        internal returns (ShareTokenUpgradeable) \n    {\n        ShareTokenUpgradeable impl = new ShareTokenUpgradeable();\n        bytes memory data = abi.encodeWithSelector(\n            ShareTokenUpgradeable.initialize.selector, name, symbol, owner\n        );\n        ERC1967Proxy proxy = new ERC1967Proxy(address(impl), data);\n        return ShareTokenUpgradeable(address(proxy));\n    }\n    \n    function _deployVault(address asset, address shareToken) \n        internal returns (ERC7575VaultUpgradeable) \n    {\n        ERC7575VaultUpgradeable impl = new ERC7575VaultUpgradeable();\n        bytes memory data = abi.encodeWithSelector(\n            ERC7575VaultUpgradeable.initialize.selector,\n            IERC20Metadata(asset), shareToken, owner\n        );\n        ERC1967Proxy proxy = new ERC1967Proxy(address(impl), data);\n        return ERC7575VaultUpgradeable(address(proxy));\n    }\n}\n\n```",
